      {
        "h_title": "Warm Up",
        "main_title": "Muay Thai Training",
        "author": "Sumalee Boxing Gym",
        "language": "en",
        "level": 3,
        "primary_content": [
          {
            "text": "It’s a chance to get blood to the working muscles, increase your heart rate, and prepare you for the next 90 minutes.",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
          },
          {
            "text": "We have skipping ropes, truck tyres, and a stunning running route on our doorstep, so take your pick and get moving!",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
          }
        ],
        "secondary_content": null,
        "table_content": null
      },
      {
        "h_title": "Shadow Boxing",
        "main_title": "Muay Thai Training",
        "author": "Sumalee Boxing Gym",
        "language": "en",
        "level": 3,
        "primary_content": [
          {
            "text": "Work on your technique and drill those movements with shadow boxing.",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
          },
          {
            "text": "Used in martial arts and Western boxing for eons, proper shadow boxing will enable you to translate to better technique on the pads and bags.",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
          }
        ],
        "secondary_content": null,
        "table_content": null
      },
      {
        "h_title": "Pad Work",
        "main_title": "Muay Thai Training",
        "author": "Sumalee Boxing Gym",
        "language": "en",
        "level": 3,
        "primary_content": [
          {
            "text": "Work 1-1 with one of our top trainers – it will help you build strength and power in your punches, elbows, knees, and kicks.",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
          },
          {
            "text": "Our trainers have a lifetime of experience as Muay Thai fighters and more recently as coaches. They cater to all experience levels and abilities.",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
          }
        ],
        "secondary_content": null,
        "table_content": null
      },
      {
        "h_title": "Heavy Bag Work",
        "main_title": "Muay Thai Training",
        "author": "Sumalee Boxing Gym",
        "language": "en",
        "level": 3,
        "primary_content": [
          {
            "text": "Heavy bag work is a tool that is as old as the sport itself, used by generations of top Muay Thai fighters.",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
          },
          {
            "text": "Designed to give you a tough workout whilst giving you the chance to work on your technique, the heavy bag rounds will leave you gasping for air!",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
          }
        ],
        "secondary_content": null,
        "table_content": null
      },
      {
        "h_title": "Sparring",
        "main_title": "Muay Thai Training",
        "author": "Sumalee Boxing Gym",
        "language": "en",
        "level": 3,
        "primary_content": [
          {
            "text": "Sparring with your peers and trainers is a fantastic way to build confidence in your Muay Thai ability. Like a practice match, you can simulate what it would be like to enter a real Muay Thai fight!",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
          },
          {
            "text": "There is no obligation to enter into sparring, you can participate in your own time.",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
          }
        ],
        "secondary_content": null,
        "table_content": null
      },
      {
        "h_title": "Clinching",
        "main_title": "Muay Thai Training",
        "author": "Sumalee Boxing Gym",
        "language": "en",
        "level": 3,
        "primary_content": [
          {
            "text": "Clinching is essential in Muay Thai, offering control, strategy, and conditioning. Our training prioritizes clinch techniques, enhancing versatility and preparing fighters for the nuanced challenges of close-quarters combat in the ring.",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
          },
          {
            "text": "Emphasizing both offense and defense, our approach ensures participants develop a well-rounded skill set, crucial for success in the dynamic and multifaceted realm of Muay Thai competition.",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
          }
        ],
        "secondary_content": null,
        "table_content": null
      },
      {
        "h_title": "Stretching and Cool Down",
        "main_title": "Muay Thai Training",
        "author": "Sumalee Boxing Gym",
        "language": "en",
        "level": 3,
        "primary_content": [
          {
            "text": "As important as your warm up is your cool down to help you stay limber and injury free for future sessions.",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
          },
          {
            "text": "Careful though, the trainers have been known to throw in one last killer round of kicks on the pads!",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
          }
        ],
        "secondary_content": null,
        "table_content": null
      }
